#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export to OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"
msgstr "Mengekspor ke OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export Qiskit code to OpenQASM 3 with `dumps()`, which exports to a "
"string, or `dump()`, which exports to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mengekspor kode Qiskit ke OpenQASM 3 dengan `dumps()`, yang "
"mengekspor ke string, atau `dump()`, yang mengekspor ke file.\n"

